The Slow Juicer accessory for the&#160;KitchenAid mixers&#160;turns&#160;any combination of fruits and vegetables into tasty, fresh and nutritious juices within seconds.
The secret lies in the two-step juice extraction process, so that, before pressing, very sharp blades will cut the fruits and vegetables, thus, ensuring a faster pressing and less resulting foam.
The juice consistency can be adjusted by using one of the 3 stainless steel sieves included, for juice with a small, medium and large fruit pulp content (suitable for sauces and jams).
The accessory is provided with&#160;2 containers, one for collecting pulp and the other one, of 1 l capacity, for juice.
This accessory can be attached to any&#160;KitchenAid mixer&#160;except the professional 5KSM7990X mixer.



